Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 20:27:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: accept SKU changes on item update

PUT /api/v1/items/{id} now takes sku, trims and uppercases it, and
returns 409 when another item already uses that SKU. Keeping the same
SKU does not run the duplicate check.
---
