 .../java/com/ndeanka/inventory/item/Item.java |  4 ++
 .../ndeanka/inventory/item/ItemService.java   |  5 +++
 .../inventory/item/UpdateItemRequest.java     |  1 +
 .../inventory/item/ItemControllerTest.java    | 26 +++++++++++
 .../inventory/item/ItemServiceTest.java       | 45 +++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 777beac..923e179 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@ All `/api/**` routes require HTTP Basic auth. Actuator health/info stay open.
 | `GET` | `/api/v1/items` | List |
 | `GET` | `/api/v1/items/{id}` | Cached in Redis (5m TTL) |
 | `POST` | `/api/v1/items` | Create (`201` + `Location`) |
-| `PUT` | `/api/v1/items/{id}` | Update + cache eviction |
+| `PUT` | `/api/v1/items/{id}` | Update SKU, name, stock, and price + cache eviction |
 | `DELETE` | `/api/v1/items/{id}` | Delete + cache eviction |
 
 ### Example
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@ curl -s -u demo:demo -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items \
   }'
 ```
 
-Duplicate SKUs return `409 Conflict`. Validation failures return `400` with field details.
+Duplicate SKUs return `409 Conflict` on create and on update. The SKU is trimmed and stored in uppercase. Validation failures return `400` with field details. `quantityOnHand` is a whole number.
 
 ## Layout
 
